5. Organiser features (what they can do)
An organiser should get an organiser dashboard.

They should be able to do stuff like:

Create an event
Edit an event
Delete an event
Manage categories
View enrolments
Enter results
Upload an event banner

The key thing is still, these actions must go through the Part 2 API, not directly from the MVC layer pretending it knows everything.

RaceDay_Part_3_MVC 

6. Participant features
A participant should be able to do:

Browse events
View event details
Enrol in an event
View their events
View their results
Update their profile
Upload a profile picture

So they get a calmer, simpler website experience that focuses on joining, checking, and managing their own events.

