9. User interface
The website should feel professional and easy to use, not like a random prototype from 2016.

It should include:

Responsive pages
Clear navigation
Consistent colors and buttons
Friendly error messages
Form validation
Proper image alt text
Navigation that changes based on role

Example: organiser sees Organiser Dashboard, while a participant sees Find Events and My Events.

