10. GitHub and CI/CD
Part 3 still uses your existing RaceDay GitHub repository.

The MVC project should be separated clearly like this:

RaceDay
│
├── RaceDayAPI
│
├── RaceDayMVC
│
├── .github
│   └── workflows
│
└── README.md

GitHub Actions should automatically:

Get the code
Set up .NET
Restore the project
Build the MVC application

That’s the CI/CD part.

